{
  "id": "MAT.17",
  "number": "17",
  "bookId": "MAT",
  "reference": "Matsayo 17",
  "verseCount": 27,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "17",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "MAT 17"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "17",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Okhukalulwa khwelikondo liaYesu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 17:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Olunyuma lwetsindaalo tsisasaba Yesu yabukula Petero nende Yakobo nende Yohana omusiani wabwe natsia ninabo mushikulu eshirambi bonyene; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.17.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.17.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 17:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nakalulwa likondolie imbeli wabwe; obwenibwe nibwakha shinga eliuba, ebiifwalobie nibikwa ebilafu, shinga omubasu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.17.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.17.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 17:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne lola, Musa nende Eliya nibabaloleshela, nibasungananga ninaye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.17.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.17.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 17:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana Petero nakalusia, namusunjila Yesu ari Omwami, neshilayi ifwe okhuba hano; noba nochama, enyumbashe hano amatili kataru, elala elilio, elindi liaMusa, nelindi liaEliya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.17.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.17.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 17:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne olwa yali nashiboolanga, lola, lileesi ling'inang'inu liabafwimba; ne lola, omwoyo okwarula mwileesi nikuboola, kuri Uno niye Omwana wanje omuheelwa; muye nimwo omwa enjamisilibungwa muno; mumuhulilenje. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.17.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.17.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 17:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne olwa abeechi bakuhulila, beekhupa hasi mafumama, indenga niyibahamba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.17.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.17.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 17:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu niyeetsa nabatiilakhwo, naboola ari Buushe; muraria tawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.17.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.17.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 17:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nibachinguula tsimoni, nibaralola omundu ta, habula Yesu yenyene.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.17.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.17.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 17:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.17.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.17.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 17:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne olwa bali nibashiikhanga okhurula mushikulu Yesu yabeetiinya, ari Muraboolela omundu yesi akelibisulo lino ta, okhuula olwa Omwana wOmundu alaba nalamuushe okhurula mubafu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.17.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.17.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 17:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abeechibe nibamureeba bari Nishiina eshichila abahandiichi nibaboolanga mbu Eliya akhoyile okhwitsa mbeli? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.17.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.17.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 17:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nakalusia nabasunjila mbu Toto mwene Eliya yeetsa, ne aleeluula ebindu biosi obuyia; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.17.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.17.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 17:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nasi emusunjila mbu Eliya yamala okhwitsa, nibaramumanya ta, ne bamukholela kosi aka bali nibeenya. Khandi nolwa Omwana wOmundu yesi aleefwila akabwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.17.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.17.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 17:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kho abeechi nibatiila khushisina mbu abasunjilanga akaYohana Omubatisii.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.17.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.17.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yesu yahonia omwana owali owelidimoni",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 17:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.17.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.17.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 17:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nolwa boola ewa omukanda kwali, omusaatsa undi namwitsila, namusikamila, nasunga mbu ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.17.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.17.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 17:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omwami, obeele omwana wanje tsimbabasi, okhuba noweindulume, ne asaalilanga okhushila; shichila khandi akhanji akwitsanga mumulilo, khandi akhanji mumatsi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.17.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.17.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 17:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ne emuleerile khubeechibo; ne bakhayilwe okhumuhonia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.17.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.17.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 17:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu nakalusia, nasunga ari Inywe abolwibulo olurambaatsanu, olurasuubila ta, ndalabeetsanga nineenywe okhuula liina? Ndalamwisimilisilia okhuula lina? Mumundeerele hano. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.17.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.17.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 17:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu namukondeshela, mana lidimoni nilimurulamwo; omwana nahona okhurula khushise eshio.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.17.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.17.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 17:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.17.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.17.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 17:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana abeechi nibeetsa ewa Yesu yali bonyene, nibareeba bari Nishiina eshichilile ifwe nikhuranyalile okhulirusia ta? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.17.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.17.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 17:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye nabasunjila ari Khulwa obuleemu bwobusuubili bweenywe; shichila emuboolela toto, mbu nimuba nimuli nende obusuubili shinga imoni ndala yolufwa Iwelisaatsi, mulasunjila eshikulu shino mbu Rula hano otsie halia; nashio shilarulaho; ne shililabaho likhuwa liosi elira munyalishila ta. [",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.17.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.17.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 17:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne imbia yino shiyirulanga ta, habula khulwa okhusaaya nokhuhonga inzala.]",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.17.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.17.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yesu yaboola khandi akokhufwakhwe",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 17:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.17.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.17.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 17:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne olwa bali nibamenyile eGalilaya Yesu yabasunjila mbu Omwana wOmundu alahaanwa mumakhono kabandu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.17.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.17.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 17:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ne balamwira, ne khunyanga yakhataru alalamusibwa. Nabo nibaba neshibeela muno.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.17.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.17.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Akokhurunga obushuru bweihekalu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 17:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.17.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.17.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 17:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nolwa bali niboolile eKaperinaumu, abasololi beinusushekeli ' nibatsia ewa Petero yali, nibareeba bari Omwechesia weenywe arunganga inusushekeli noho? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.17.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.17.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 17:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nakalusia mbu Ee, arunganga. Ne olwa yeenjila munzu, Yesu yaranjilila okhumureeba, ari Simoni, oluutsi orie? Abaruchi abomushialo, nabandu shiina aba baroosinjia nibabarunjia obushuru? Mbu abaana babwe, nohomba abarende? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.17.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.17.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 17:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne olwa yakalusia mbu Mbula, abarende; Yesu namuboolela mbu Khulwako abaana abeebule nabalekhuule. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.17.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.17.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 17:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nebutswa, mbu khuleshe okhubasinyisia, otsie khunyanza, ofuube olulobo, obukule inyeenu eyo eyiranjilila okhufutukhakhwo, ne olwa aloba niwikuule omunwa kwayo, olanyoola ishekeli; ochibukule, obarunje khulwanje khandi khululwo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.17.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.17.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
